Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.01,0:00:03.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Previously on JoJo's Bizarre Adventure...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.07,0:00:17.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Blast it!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.35,0:00:19.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh no, the exit's blocked with ice!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.01,0:00:21.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And more is coming this way!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.45,0:00:23.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, shits!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.89,0:00:27.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's time to cover the whole tunnel!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.89,0:00:30.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I gotta find a way out of this death trap!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.43,0:00:39.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.63,0:00:41.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, my paw!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.25,0:00:45.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't rip my paw loose!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.39,0:01:21.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:21.49,0:01:24.33,SC Opening 2 Eng,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(960,953)}Seeking out...
Dialogue: 1,0:02:50.54,0:02:55.67,Title 3,title,0,0,0,,{\fad(640,686)\pos(150,877)}Episode 39: The Guardian of Hell, Pet Shop, Part 2
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.63,0:02:57.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, the sun is about to set.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.55,0:02:59.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Didn't Shade say three hours?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.61,0:03:01.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Guess that cocky beggar had a bit more
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.53,0:03:04.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,trouble finding Dio's\Nmansion than he thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.19,0:03:06.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can't say I was expecting\Nthis to happen, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.97,0:03:08.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right, Avdol?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.05,0:03:10.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have a bad feeling.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.29,0:03:14.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe it's better if he doesn't\Nfind that accursed mansion.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.49,0:03:15.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm? Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.89,0:03:20.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You see, maybe he hasn't come\Nback, because he did find it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.65,0:03:22.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.56,0:03:23.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.49,0:03:25.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It didn't occur to me until a moment ago,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.85,0:03:28.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but a stand user is likely\Nto be guarding Dio's lair.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.51,0:03:31.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We may have put that beggar's\Nlife in grave danger,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.63,0:03:35.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,if he hasn't already been\Nkilled. What? Are you serious?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.61,0:04:05.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Son of a...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.53,0:04:07.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I barely made it out of there.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.93,0:04:08.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And my...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.84,0:04:10.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,my leg is...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.29,0:04:13.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That ice caught my paw like a bear trap.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.49,0:04:15.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd be dead if I hadn't gnawed it off.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.17,0:04:19.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think I'm gonna hide\Nout here for a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.99,0:04:23.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I'm down here long enough,\Nmaybe Bird Brain will go away.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.57,0:04:28.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After this is over, the Speedwagon\NFoundation can make me an artificial leg.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.51,0:04:30.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I'm still pissed as hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.31,0:04:31.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn that bird.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.49,0:04:33.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're not getting away with this.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.51,0:04:36.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna make you suffer\Nfor what you did to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.41,0:04:37.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just you wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.05,0:04:40.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, that sound!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.85,0:04:43.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Something out there dove into the water.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.41,0:04:46.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.59,0:04:50.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Birds have the capacity\Nto dive underwater.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.77,0:04:55.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Like humans and canines, birds are\Nreliant upon lungs for respiration.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.11,0:04:59.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But the average bird\Nhas five to six air sacs
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.65,0:05:02.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,stored away in its chest\Nand stomach regions.
