Dialogue: 2,0:05:03.05,0:05:19.31,SC 39 Typesetting,sign,0,0,0,,{\bord0\blur0.6\pos(1060.8,75.6)\be(2)\shad2\4a&HFF&}Lungs
Dialogue: 1,0:05:03.05,0:05:19.31,SC 39 Typesetting,sign,0,0,0,,{\blur0.6\pos(1668,110)\be(2)\c&HFFFFFF&}Air Sac
Dialogue: 2,0:05:03.05,0:05:19.31,SC 39 Typesetting,sign,0,0,0,,{\bord0\blur0.6\pos(1668,110)\be(2)\shad2\4a&HFF&}Air Sac
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.43,0:05:06.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's these pockets of air\Nthat give birds the ability to
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.47,0:05:09.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,remain conscious at altitudes\Nof six to seven thousand meters,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.95,0:05:12.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,a feat completely impossible for humans.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.79,0:05:14.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even if it were to be strangled,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.63,0:05:19.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,a bird can survive for several minutes\Nthanks to its internal air reserves.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.09,0:05:23.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,With these advantages, a bird can survive\Nunderwater much longer than a dog.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.15,0:05:33.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It sounds like something's\Nheaded straight for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.65,0:05:34.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But how?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.77,0:05:35.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.49,0:05:40.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't understand what could\Nbe coming after me down here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.99,0:05:41.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait a sec.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.41,0:05:43.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Could it be?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.33,0:05:56.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's that bird again.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.97,0:05:59.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But how can it survive\Nunderwater like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.75,0:06:07.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That bastard.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.29,0:06:09.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where'd it fly off to now?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.31,0:06:23.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's closing in.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.81,0:06:25.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But what's its plan?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.27,0:06:26.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,More icicles?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.67,0:06:29.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One, two, three! Great!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.07,0:06:32.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Three icicles are coming this way!
