Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.29,0:06:56.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, I did it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.11,0:06:58.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How do you like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.29,0:07:13.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The icicles are stopping\Nthe wall from leaking.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.17,0:07:16.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But at the rate they're spreading,\Nthey're going to cover everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.07,0:07:19.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, what am I going to do now?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.09,0:07:25.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know what it's doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.01,0:07:28.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's focusing on freezing\Nthe water around me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.53,0:07:37.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And it's cut my air pipes.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.65,0:07:40.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't think it's trying to suffocate me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.03,0:07:43.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Its real plan is to bury me alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.27,0:07:50.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's no use!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.23,0:07:51.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's collapsing!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.27,0:07:54.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This bird is too powerful\Nfor me to hold it off!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.39,0:07:57.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And much worse, I'm surrounded\Nby ice and freezing water!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.61,0:07:58.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just my damn luck!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.83,0:08:02.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So much for finding a decent hiding\Nplace to lay low in for a while!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.63,0:08:05.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No other choice!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.99,0:08:08.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have to dig my way out! Give me a break!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.61,0:08:12.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This stupid day has gone from bad to\Nhorrifying in the worst possible way!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.49,0:08:17.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,First I lose my leg and now some demon bird\Nwants me flattened into a frozen dinner!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.55,0:08:20.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn, I can't hold it off anymore!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.67,0:08:22.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm about to be crushed!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.85,0:08:25.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I need to dig myself out of here now!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.19,0:08:33.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.21,0:08:34.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.47,0:08:37.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It looks like someone dug a\Ntunnel down here. But why?
