Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.07,0:08:50.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's getting ready to\Nshoot another ice missile.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.47,0:08:55.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn it my stand is being held by the ice.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.73,0:09:01.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't defend myself and\Nthere's nowhere for me to escape?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.43,0:09:06.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, that's it!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.87,0:09:10.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Either way, you slice it, it's Tarot time!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.81,0:09:17.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll let the dome break!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.75,0:09:21.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And use the air pressure to catapult\Nme forward like a spitty bullet!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.17,0:09:55.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I got out of there alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.13,0:09:59.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That dumb bird didn't have to\Ndie, but it left me no choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.77,0:10:01.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One of us had to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.21,0:10:07.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But it looks like this\Nwill probably be the end
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.61,0:10:10.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For me, I've been bleeding\Nout for a while now.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.09,0:10:14.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hardly have enough strength in\Nmy body to keep myself afloat.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.79,0:10:18.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let alone make it back to shore\Nwhich means I'm gonna drown.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.49,0:10:25.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why is this happening I was supposed\Nto live a trouble-free life?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.55,0:10:51.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Orchestra plays.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.63,0:11:10.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn it, I messed up.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.95,0:11:46.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank goodness I found you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.79,0:11:51.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As soon as I saw that little face and\Nthose great big ears, I knew it was you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.27,0:11:53.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's that stupid bird's\Nfault that you're like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.71,0:11:55.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It attacked you just like my dogs.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.29,0:12:03.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're going to pull through this.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.11,0:12:05.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The bird's gone, so there's\Nnothing to worry about.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.95,0:12:07.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Try to hang on, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.61,0:12:08.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Keep fighting.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.63,0:12:10.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll fix you right up!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.69,0:12:15.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The bird.
