Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.39,0:12:40.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn that mangy mutt, where\Nthe hell did he run off to?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.85,0:12:43.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's got to stop pulling stunts like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.59,0:12:46.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm starting to get worried,\Nhe's been gone for a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.23,0:12:48.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That lousy fleabag.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.79,0:12:54.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jotaro, what's the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.37,0:12:59.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There must be someone following us again.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.79,0:13:05.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not quite, but I thought I heard a voice.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.77,0:13:07.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Like someone's calling out to us?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.95,0:13:09.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A voice?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.53,0:13:21.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's... Iggy!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.97,0:13:30.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Iggy!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.71,0:13:34.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What on earth happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.13,0:13:36.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look at that.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.17,0:13:38.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's got injuries all over his body. Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.05,0:13:41.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Iggy's missing his front leg, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.35,0:13:43.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You think he got run over by a car?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.43,0:13:47.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's not the kind of dog\Nthat gets into car accidents.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.09,0:13:52.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You were attacked by\Nthe enemy, weren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.17,0:13:55.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.29,0:13:58.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It looks as though someone\Ntreated his wounds.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.23,0:14:00.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have to say, they did a great job.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.13,0:14:04.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But it wasn't Iggy that I heard.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.09,0:14:08.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoever was calling out to\Nus was definitely human.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.39,0:14:13.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Iggy did have a run-in with the enemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.51,0:14:15.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When we found him,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.97,0:14:17.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,he was half-dead in the arms of a boy,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.91,0:14:21.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so the Speedwagon Foundation\Ndoctors saw to his wounds.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.25,0:14:23.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They did the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.83,0:14:27.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For my eyes. It's you!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.41,0:14:28.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're finally back!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.11,0:14:38.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's Kakyoin!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.11,0:14:42.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good to see you, Kakyoin!\NHow's it going? Kakyoin!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.45,0:14:44.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tell me, how are your eyes treating you?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.89,0:14:46.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm glad you're all safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.47,0:14:47.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We missed you, pal.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.89,0:14:51.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, they were able to treat you?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.25,0:14:52.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, I'm ready for action.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.95,0:14:56.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,While it's true I'll have a few\Nscars, my eyesight is back to normal.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.07,0:14:59.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're all really glad to hear that.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.09,0:15:04.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jotaro.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.91,0:15:15.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where do you think you're going, Iggy?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.31,0:15:19.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He may have been quite indifferent\Ntoward humans and stands in the past,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.93,0:15:22.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but now it looks like he's\Ntrying to lead us somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.87,0:15:26.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not aware of all the details surrounding\Nhis encounter with the enemy stand,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.51,0:15:28.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but judging from his resolve,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.89,0:15:30.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,this is about revenge.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.85,0:15:33.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe, but that still doesn't\Nexplain where he's taking us.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.01,0:15:34.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hang on, Iggy!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.15,0:15:36.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait for us!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.21,0:15:53.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I recognize that car.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.41,0:15:57.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's the same fancy ride the beggar was
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.03,0:16:01.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,driving could this\Nwreckage mean that he...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.63,0:16:03.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But how?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.99,0:16:08.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's strong enough to tear a hole through\Na car like a piece of wet newspaper?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.85,0:16:11.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It would seem as though I was\Nright to be concerned about him.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.07,0:16:14.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He should have never been involved.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.03,0:16:19.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is it possible this is the handiwork\Nof the Stan user Iggy fought earlier?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.77,0:16:23.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All signs seem to point to\Nthat being the case. Huh? Iggy!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.59,0:16:42.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.15,0:16:45.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All of a sudden, I'm\Ndrenched in a cold sweat.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.85,0:16:49.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And there's this oppressive\Nfeeling of doom roaming in the air.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.61,0:16:57.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know about you guys,\Nbut I am majorly creeped out.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.57,0:16:59.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where exactly is Iggy trying to take us?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.35,0:17:06.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know where he's going, this feeling.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.33,0:17:09.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's all too familiar to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.99,0:17:13.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This aura is pure, unmitigated evil.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.87,0:17:21.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's the mansion from the picture.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.77,0:17:24.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've arrived.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.29,0:17:29.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Iggy, you're able to find it by yourself?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.33,0:17:43.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What lay before Jotaro and\Nthe others was something
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.35,0:17:46.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,more sinister than anything\Nthey'd previously faced.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.41,0:17:48.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They would soon look\Nupon the source of their
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.55,0:17:51.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,predicament and the\Nvery embodiment of evil.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.27,0:17:55.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The path that had led them\Nhere was long and arduous.
