Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.09,0:17:59.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Foreign lands shrouded in\Nmystery and treacherous
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.11,0:18:02.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,stand-using assassins\Nmet them at every step.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.51,0:18:04.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Each battle was a struggle for survival,
