Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.71,0:18:15.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The journey affected them all.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:14.13,0:18:20.05,Insert Jap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Hyakunen me no mezameni yobarete
Dialogue: 1,0:18:14.13,0:18:20.05,Insert Eng,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Will awaken a century-old destiny
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.15,0:18:17.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.06,0:18:20.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,nearly 50 days have passed\Nsince the team departed
Dialogue: 1,0:18:20.05,0:18:25.10,Insert Jap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Otoko tachi wa mukau
Dialogue: 1,0:18:20.05,0:18:25.10,Insert Eng,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}A group of men must depart
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.67,0:18:23.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Japan on their quest to save\Nthe life of Jotaro's mother,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.81,0:18:24.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Holly.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:25.10,0:18:30.48,Insert Jap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Toki no suna wo koeru journey
Dialogue: 1,0:18:25.10,0:18:30.48,Insert Eng,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}On a journey through the sands of time
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.55,0:18:26.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everything led to this.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.17,0:18:29.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The time had come to\Ndefeat Dio and end the
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.71,0:18:32.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,100-year curse afflicting\Nthe Joestar family.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:30.48,0:18:33.27,Insert Jap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Kusari no you tsuranaru
Dialogue: 1,0:18:30.48,0:18:33.27,Insert Eng,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Their karma links them together
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.65,0:18:35.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Joseph was determined to\Nsave his daughter, Holly,
Dialogue: 1,0:18:33.27,0:18:36.44,Insert Jap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Karamiau karuma
Dialogue: 1,0:18:33.27,0:18:36.44,Insert Eng,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Like a chain
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.55,0:18:38.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and nothing and no one was\Ngoing to stand in his way.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:36.44,0:18:42.82,Insert Jap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Hikari de tatsu sadame
Dialogue: 1,0:18:36.44,0:18:42.82,Insert Eng,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}A fate that becomes obscured by the light
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.49,0:18:41.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kakyoin vowed to remain resolute.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.13,0:18:47.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He would defeat Dio not only to save\NHolly, but to overcome his own weaknesses.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:44.16,0:18:50.12,Insert Jap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Stand Up Stand Up Stand Up uchikomu no wa
Dialogue: 1,0:18:44.16,0:18:50.12,Insert Eng,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Stand up, stand up, stand up, shoot straight ahead
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.37,0:18:50.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Avdol was steadfast in his conviction,
Dialogue: 1,0:18:50.12,0:18:55.96,Insert Jap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}All Right Now All Right Now All Right Now hokori no bullet
Dialogue: 1,0:18:50.12,0:18:55.96,Insert Eng,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}All right now, all right now, all right now, a bullet of pride
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.89,0:18:54.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,considering it his personal duty to\Nroot out evil wherever it lurked.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:55.96,0:19:01.47,Insert Jap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Break You Down Break You Down Break You Down kobushi hanatsu
Dialogue: 1,0:18:55.96,0:19:01.47,Insert Eng,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Break you down, break you down, break you down, let loose your fists
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.97,0:18:59.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Polnareff was determined to make\Nthe tyrant Dio suffer for turning
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.67,0:19:03.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,him into a puppet and forcing\Nhim to betray his own principles.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:01.47,0:19:04.81,Insert Jap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Seinaru Vision Stand...
Dialogue: 1,0:19:01.47,0:19:04.81,Insert Eng,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}This sacred vision will Stand...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.69,0:19:06.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Iggy's spirit was untamable.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:04.81,0:19:10.44,Insert Jap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Stand Up Stand Up Stand Up tachihadakaru
Dialogue: 1,0:19:04.81,0:19:10.44,Insert Eng,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Stand up, stand up, stand up, to those that stand in your way
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.55,0:19:10.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He knew his life of turmoil\Ncould be traced back to
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.39,0:19:14.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,a single man and was Intent\Non making sure the bastard
Dialogue: 1,0:19:10.44,0:19:16.32,Insert Jap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}All Right Now All Right Now All Right Now teki wo taoshi
Dialogue: 1,0:19:10.44,0:19:16.32,Insert Eng,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}All right now, all right now, all right now, show them no mercy
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.13,0:19:19.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,faced his wrath and so in\Nother words if we Beat the
Dialogue: 1,0:19:16.32,0:19:21.95,Insert Jap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Break You Down Break You Down Break You Down michi wo hiraku
Dialogue: 1,0:19:16.32,0:19:21.95,Insert Eng,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Break you down, break you down, break you down, carve out your own path
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.65,0:19:22.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,shit out of Dio in there this\Ndamn nightmare will be over
Dialogue: 1,0:19:21.95,0:19:27.59,Insert Jap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Tamashi no Vision Stand Proud!
Dialogue: 1,0:19:21.95,0:19:27.59,Insert Eng,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}May your spirit's vision Stand Proud!
