Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.85,0:19:57.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The gate's open as if\Nthey're inviting us in.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.65,0:20:00.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is totally different\Nfrom the situation yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.35,0:20:16.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now that I think about\Nit, if I can sense Dio,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.25,0:20:20.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,then it stands to reason that he\Nhas the ability to sense us too.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.49,0:20:26.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If we try to enter the\Nmansion guns blazing,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.33,0:20:29.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,no doubt we'll be playing\Nright into the enemy's hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.77,0:20:33.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Before we do anything, we\Nneed to think of a strategy.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.41,0:20:41.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Careful, the door is opening!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.27,0:20:42.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everyone on guard!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.73,0:20:59.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Check it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.15,0:21:01.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's with this weird corridor?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.81,0:21:03.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It must go on forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.91,0:21:05.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This can't be real, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.81,0:21:08.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It has to be some sort\Nof trick or illusion.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.27,0:21:11.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen, Polnareff, no matter\Nwhat, don't go through the door.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.93,0:21:16.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dio's probably got a couple more stand\Nusers waiting in the wings to fight us.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.09,0:21:17.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.00,0:21:19.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Something's coming this way!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.01,0:21:23.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, is that guy floating?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.61,0:21:25.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is he a stand-user or what?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.79,0:21:45.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Master Joestar, welcome to our abode.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.77,0:21:47.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've been expecting you, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.91,0:21:50.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am the resident butler of the mansion.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.09,0:22:04.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.11,0:22:38.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:26.52,0:23:28.53,Next Episode,,0,0,0,,{\fs120\pos(960,730)}Next Episode{PREVIEW IS NOT UP TO DATE}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.13,0:23:30.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll wager that Star\NPlatinum's first attack will...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.49,0:23:32.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let him have it already, Jotaro!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.71,0:23:34.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm entering the turn at full speed!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.55,0:23:36.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're saying if we don't defeat you,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.13,0:23:38.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we won't be able to get\Nback to the real world?
